# The finder commands whose dialog or wizard tool/capture_screens.sh captures, one per line, as words the finder
# matches with that command first, or as `WORDS => PRESSED` where its entry where it lives is worded otherwise.
# Those that only ask come first; those that would act once confirmed come last, where a confirmation is captured
# and put away with Escape.
